 huge deal sony owned  the rights to peter parker  and all related characters but was  essentially leasing the character to  marvel's creative team  while keeping most of the profits in  april 2021 the companies furthered the  deal  ensuring that tom holland's spider-man  films would soon be available on disney  plus  after previously being available only on  netflix spider-man fully joining the mcu  was a long time coming and  fans are equally as excited to see the  fantastic four stake their claim in the  universe  big fan of spider-man yeah we'll talk  about it later just hey everyone  good job meanwhile while we're pretty  sure that the 2005 fantastic four film  will reappear on disney plus at some  point in the future  mcu fans can also look forward to  marvel's first family making a big  cinematic comeback  a fantastic four project is in the works  for the marvel cinematic universe  with spider-man director john watts  slated to direct  it's likely the film will be hitting the  screen sometime in 2023  although no further information is yet  available that of course hasn't stopped  fans from speculating about what an mcu  fantastic four could look like  many marvel devotees are dead set on  john krasinski  joining the universe as reed richards  with his real-life wife emily blunt as  sue storm  other popular fan castings for mr  fantastic include  i zombie star rahul coley and the good  place leading man william jackson harper  however none of the actors whose names  have been tossed around have admitted to  speaking to the studio about roles  although coley at least has openly  campaigned for the role and marvel  hasn't released any information about  casting  that said the studio is laying the  groundwork for the fantastic four's  arrival  we met a variant of kang the conqueror  in the loki finale  although he was introduced in that  episode only as he who remains  as comic fans know kang is commonly  thought to be a descendant or  relative of reed richards 